      "description": "An input inside a station workbench with route-colored focus rail.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span>QUERY</span><input placeholder=\"搜索知识线路…\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:grid;gap:6px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary,#647589);font:540 12px/1.4 var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.07em}.ds-field input{height:40px;min-width:260px;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid var(--color-border-strong,#849493);border-radius:8px 8px 3px 3px;padding:0 12px;background:var(--color-surface-muted,#e7ebe8);color:var(--color-text,#0b203a);font:400 15px/1.6 var(--font-sans,system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-field input:focus-visible{border-bottom-color:var(--station-color,var(--route-cobalt,#1766c2));outline:2px solid var(--color-ring,#155fc6);outline-offset:2px}.ds-field input::placeholder{color:var(--color-text-tertiary,#647589)}"
    },
