      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "Compact route, evidence, or OPC context metadata.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>OPC · AI-native</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 10px;background:var(--color-surface-muted,#e7ebe8);color:var(--color-text,#0b203a);font:540 12px/1 var(--font-sans,system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-chip i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--route-green,#16845b)}.ds-chip:hover{background:var(--color-surface-hover,#dce6e4)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-ring,#155fc6);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Transit Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "A warm porcelain or midnight enamel station sheet.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><small>C1 · COMPILE GATE</small><h3>编译门不直接相信生成</h3><p>不能证明的内容不会伪装成 canonical。</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{width:320px;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;background:var(--color-card,#fffef9);color:var(--color-text,#0b203a);box-shadow:var(--shadow-subtle,0 8px 26px rgb(20 45 65 / 8%));font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-card small{color:var(--route-scarlet,#d73a49);font:540 12px/1.4 var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.07em}.ds-card h3{margin:12px 0 7px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.035em}.ds-card p{margin:0;color:var(--color-text-secondary,#40556b);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}.ds-card:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--color-ring,#155fc6);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Active Route Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "The current route in the grouped system navigation.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-route-nav\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>系统线路<i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button>",
      "css": ".ds-route-nav{display:grid;width:188px;min-height:38px;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:0 12px;background:var(--color-surface-inverse,#0b203a);color:var(--color-text-inverse,#fbf8ed);box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgb(11 32 58 / 13%);font:540 13px/1.2 var(--font-sans,system-ui,sans-serif);text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-route-nav svg{width:15px;height:15px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8}.ds-route-nav i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-accent,#df4a2b)}.ds-route-nav:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}.ds-route-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-ring,#155fc6);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Six-station Knowledge Route",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "The full Source-to-Git architecture route, preserved at 390px.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-atlas-route\"><li class=\"ds-green\"><b>S0</b><span>原始材料<small>对话、文档与代码片段</small></span></li><li class=\"ds-green\"><b>P0</b><span>PostgreSQL<small>权威来源与摄取计划</small></span></li><li class=\"ds-cobalt\"><b>L1</b><span>Meilisearch<small>词法层，可重建</small></span></li><li class=\"ds-amber\"><b>L2</b><span>Qdrant<small>语义层，可重建</small></span></li><li class=\"ds-scarlet\"><b>C1</b><span>编译门<small>取证、合并与结构化</small></span></li><li class=\"ds-scarlet\"><b>G1</b><span>Canonical Git<small>可审阅、可回滚的版本</small></span></li></ol>",
      "css": ".ds-atlas-route{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(118px,1fr));gap:0;margin:0;padding:28px;border-radius:22px;background:var(--route-map-bg,#0b203a);color:var(--route-map-text,#f8f4e8);list-style:none;font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-atlas-route li{position:relative;display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:10px;text-align:center}.ds-atlas-route li:not(:last-child)::after{position:absolute;z-index:0;top:19px;left:50%;width:100%;height:5px;background:currentColor;content:''}.ds-atlas-route b{z-index:1;display:grid;width:42px;height:42px;place-items:center;border:5px solid currentColor;border-radius:50%;background:var(--route-map-bg,#0b203a);color:var(--route-map-text,#f8f4e8);font:700 12px/1 var(--font-mono,monospace)}.ds-atlas-route span{font-size:15px;font-weight:540}.ds-atlas-route small{display:block;margin-top:3px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--route-map-text,#f8f4e8) 62%,transparent);font-size:12px;font-weight:400}.ds-atlas-route .ds-green{color:var(--route-green,#16845b)}.ds-atlas-route .ds-cobalt{color:var(--route-cobalt,#1766c2)}.ds-atlas-route .ds-amber{color:var(--route-amber,#d9900d)}.ds-atlas-route .ds-scarlet{color:var(--route-scarlet,#d73a49)}@media(max-width:820px){.ds-atlas-route{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:20px}.ds-atlas-route li{min-height:68px;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr;align-items:center;justify-items:start;gap:13px;text-align:left}.ds-atlas-route li:not(:last-child)::after{top:42px;bottom:-6px;left:21px;width:3px;height:auto}.ds-atlas-route span{color:var(--route-map-text,#f8f4e8)}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Live Destination Sheet",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "A high-contrast station sheet that exposes a real source-to-version trace.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-destination\"><header><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><b>S0</b><small>LIVE TRACE</small></header><h3>一条真实证据线路已点亮</h3><dl><div><dt>SOURCE / SPAN</dt><dd>source-a1 · ¶0–0</dd></div><div><dt>CLAIM ANCHOR</dt><dd>c:8e78019b</dd></div><div><dt>CANONICAL</dt><dd>work/experiments/retrieval.md</dd></div><div><dt>PATCH / REF</dt><dd>f3c4213f</dd></div></dl><button>查验这段原文 →</button></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-destination{width:290px;border-radius:20px;padding:20px;background:var(--route-map-panel,#fffaf0);color:var(--route-map-ink,#0b203a);box-shadow:0 16px 42px rgb(0 0 0 / 20%);font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-destination header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.ds-destination header i{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--route-green,#16845b)}.ds-destination header b,.ds-destination header small,.ds-destination dt,.ds-destination dd{font-family:var(--font-mono,monospace)}.ds-destination header small{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em}.ds-destination h3{margin:28px 0 16px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2}.ds-destination dl{display:grid;gap:10px}.ds-destination dl div{border-left:2px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--route-green,#16845b) 58%,transparent);padding-left:9px}.ds-destination dt{font-size:12px;color:#6f7d89;letter-spacing:.06em}.ds-destination dd{overflow:hidden;margin:2px 0 0;font-size:12px;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.ds-destination button{margin-top:20px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;padding:0 0 2px;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:540 13px/1.4 var(--font-sans,system-ui,sans-serif);cursor:pointer}.ds-destination button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-ring,#155fc6);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evidence Journey",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "A real four-step source, claim, canonical, and Git journey.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-journey\"><li class=\"ds-green\"><b>01</b><small>SOURCE</small><strong>source-a1</strong></li><li class=\"ds-cobalt\"><b>02</b><small>CLAIM</small><strong>c:8e78019b</strong></li><li class=\"ds-amber\"><b>03</b><small>CANONICAL</small><strong>retrieval.md</strong></li><li class=\"ds-scarlet\"><b>04</b><small>PATCH / GIT</small><strong>f3c4213f</strong></li></ol>",
      "css": ".ds-journey{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-journey::before{position:absolute;top:17px;right:8%;left:3%;height:4px;background:var(--color-border-subtle,#dfe5e1);content:''}.ds-journey li{position:relative;padding:55px 20px 0 0}.ds-journey b{position:absolute;z-index:1;top:0;left:0;display:grid;width:38px;height:38px;place-items:center;border:7px solid var(--color-surface,#f2f1e9);border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px currentColor;color:#fff;font:700 12px/1 var(--font-mono,monospace)}.ds-journey small{display:block;color:var(--color-text-tertiary,#647589);font:540 12px/1.4 var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.08em}.ds-journey strong{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:var(--color-text,#0b203a);font-size:15px}.ds-journey .ds-green{color:var(--route-green,#16845b)}.ds-journey .ds-cobalt{color:var(--route-cobalt,#1766c2)}.ds-journey .ds-amber{color:var(--route-amber,#d9900d)}.ds-journey .ds-scarlet{color:var(--route-scarlet,#d73a49)}@media(max-width:820px){.ds-journey{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}.ds-journey::before{top:0;bottom:0;left:17px;width:4px;height:auto}.ds-journey li{min-height:74px;padding:4px 0 0 62px}}"
    },
